, 14)\ncores/bench/test/test_mdiv_unit.py:    await _check(dut, ALU_DIVU, 0xFFFFFFFF, 2, 0x7FFFFFFF)\ncores/bench/test/test_mdiv_unit.py:    await _check(dut, ALU_DIV, 0xFFFFFFFC, 2, 0xFFFFFFFE)\ncores/bench/test/test_mdiv_unit.py:    await _check(dut, ALU_R\n…[12143 of 15215 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:01b50a565c36d586]…\n localparam logic [4:0] ALU_SLTU   = 5'd6;\ncores/bench/rtl/00_core_pkg_first.sv:  localparam logic [4:0] ALU_SLL    = 5'd7;\ncores/bench/rtl/00_core_pkg_first.sv:  localparam logic [4:0] ALU_SRL    = 5'd8;\ncores/bench/rtl/00_core_pkg_first.sv:  localparam logic [4:0] ALU_SRA    = 5'd9;\ncores/bench/rtl/00_core_pkg_first.sv:  localparam logic [4:0] ALU_LUI    = 5'd10;\ncores/bench/rtl/00_core_pkg_first.sv:  localparam logic [4:0] ALU_MUL    = 5'd11;\ncores/bench/rtl/00_core_pkg_first.sv:  localparam logic [4:0] ALU_MULH   = 5'd12;\ncores/bench/rtl/00_core_pkg_first.sv:  localparam logic [4:0] ALU_MULHU  = 5'd13;\ncores/bench/rtl/00_core_pkg_first.sv:  localparam logic [4:0] ALU_MULHSU = 5'd14;\ncores/bench/rtl/00_core_pkg_first.sv:  localparam logic [4:0] ALU_DIV    = 5'd15;\ncores/bench/rtl/00_core_pkg_first.sv:  localparam logic [4:0] ALU_DIVU   = 5'd16;\ncores/bench/rtl/00_core_pkg_first.sv:  localparam logic [4:0] ALU_REM    = 5'd17;\ncores/bench/rtl/00_core_pkg_first.sv:  localparam logic [4:0] ALU_REMU   = 5'd18;\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
