{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"agent_message","text":"The key correctness wrinkle is load-produced bases. ALU results in `EX/MEM` are usable for the ID AGU, but load data is not, so a load feeding a later load/store base needs to wait until `MEM/WB`. I’m going to make that interlock explicit instead of trying to smuggle a live dmem read back into ID."}}
