{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_20","type":"agent_message","text":"Before editing, one subtlety worth carrying through: a multicycle M op may have consumed forwarded operands that vanish from MEM/WB long before the divider finishes. I’m going to latch the forwarded rs1/rs2 at M start so RVFI reports the actual operands used, not whatever happens to be forwardable on the finish cycle."}}
