d be silently dropped, the\ncores/bench/rtl/if_stage.sv:44:    if      (reset)    pc <= RESET_PC;\ncores/bench/rtl/if_stage.sv:45:    else if (redirect) pc <= redirect_target;\ncores/bench/rtl/if_stage.sv:46:    else if (!stall)   pc <= next_pc;\ncores/bench/rtl/if_stage.sv:54:    out.valid = imem_ready && !redirect;\ncores/bench/rtl/hazard_unit.sv:8://   stall_if / stall_id : freeze the PC reg and the IF/ID combinational\ncores/bench/rtl/hazard_unit.sv:10://   flush_id            : kills ID's register on redirect or load-use to\ncores/bench/rtl/hazard_unit.sv:11://                          inject a bubble. IF carries redirect/imem kills\ncores/bench/rtl/hazard_unit.sv:23:  input  logic       redirect,          // EX has resolved a branch/jump\ncores/bench/rtl/hazard_unit.sv:27:  input  logic       imem_ready,\ncores/bench/rtl/hazard_unit.sv:34:  output logic       stall_if,          // PC reg holds\ncores/bench/rtl/hazard_unit.sv:36:  output logic       flush_id,          // ID/EX register captures '0\ncores/bench/rtl/hazard_unit.sv:52:    imem_stall = !imem_ready;\ncores/bench/rtl/hazard_unit.sv:58:    stall_if      = load_use_hazard || imem_stall || dmem_stall || ex_long_stall;\ncores/bench/rtl/hazard_unit.sv:63:    //   - redirect    -> bubble      (kill wrong-path)\ncores/bench/rtl/hazard_unit.sv:66:    // load_use next cycle when the bus unblocks. flush_id is 1 only when\ncores/bench/rtl/hazard_unit.sv:69:    flush_id      = (load_use_hazard || redirect) && !dmem_stall && !ex_long_stall;\ncores/bench/rtl/ex_stage.sv:4:// MEM/WB), runs the ALU, resolves branches, computes the redirect\ncores/bench/rtl/ex_stage.sv:26:  output logic               redirect,\ncores/bench/rtl/ex_stage.sv:27:  output logic [31:0]        redirect_target\ncores/bench/rtl/ex_stage.sv:153:  // instruction, suppress the redirect (PC stays linear), and clear\ncores/bench/rtl/ex_stage.sv:173:  assign redirect        = (branch_taken || in.ctrl.is_jump) && !misalign_fault;\ncores/bench/rtl/ex