it for DIV/REM ops, hold the EX instruction while it is busy, and capture the completed result into EX/MEM exactly once.\"\n  - file: rtl/hazard_unit.sv\n    description: \"Add an EX long-operation stall input that freezes IF/ID and ID/EX without double-retiring downstream instructions.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Wire the EX long-operation stall into the existing hazard and pipeline hold logic.\"\n  - file: test/test_mdiv_unit.py\n    description: \"Add focused cocotb vectors for divider/remainder corner cases so the new sequential unit is checked independently of CoreMark.\"\n\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
