on the fast path.\"\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"Start the high-half multiply unit for MULH/MULHU/MULHSU, OR its busy/done sequencing into the existing long_stall path, and capture the completed result into EX/MEM exactly once.\"\n  - file: test/test_alu.py\n    description: \"Adjust the ALU unit coverage to keep RV32I and single-cycle low-half MUL checks on rtl/alu.sv after high-half multiply leaves the combinational ALU.\"\n  - file: test/test_mulh_unit.py\n    description: \"Add focused MULH/MULHU/MULHSU signed and unsigned corner vectors for the new iterative high-half unit so RV32M bit semantics remain covered.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
