/sub, logic, compare, shift, LUI, and multiply result selects, preserving RISCV_FORMAL_ALTOPS substitutions and zeroed real DIV/REM outputs.\"\n  - file: rtl/decoder.sv\n    description: \"Audit decoded ALU op assignments against the new encodings so every legal opcode still selects the same architectural result and illegal defaults remain trap-first.\"\n  - file: test/test_alu.py\n    description: \"Preserve or extend ALU opcode coverage across RV32I and RV32M operations to catch any encoding or grouped-mux decode mistakes.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
