n- 2026-10-03 hyp-20261003-002-r3s1 (placement_failed, n/a): Store-buffer arbitration that muxes registered addr/data/mask onto the dmem port can break Gowin BRAM inference for the byte-lane dmem wrapper, exploding a 2Kx8 lane into 16,384 DFFs.\n- 2026-10-03 hyp-20261003-003-r3s2 (regression, -34.57%): Even RET-only prediction can be too expensive when exact JALR return decode from imem_data and ras_top selection feed the IF next-PC path; CoreMark return bubbles did not repay the added fetch compare/mux cone.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
