0.84\t-0.98\t54.279\t4491817\t2668\t15\tSplit memory AGU path\nhyp-20261003-003-r5s2\tpredictor\tregression\t118.53\t-2.88\t51.081\t4309463\t2805\t12\tDecode-stage backward branch predictor\nhyp-20261003-001-r6s0\tmicro_opt\tregression\t120.97\t-0.88\t54.337\t4491735\t2969\t12\tMove MULH variants off fast ALU\nhyp-20261003-002-r6s1\tstructural\tregression\t121.0\t-0.85\t54.353\t4491817\t2709\t12\tRegister decode-time forwarding selects\nhyp-20261003-003-r6s2\tpredictor\tregression\t88.85\t-27.2\t38.081\t4286200\t3152\t26\tDecode-stage learned target predictor\nhyp-20261003-001-r7s0\tmicro_opt\tregression\t116.04\t-4.92\t52.122\t4491817\t2783\t13\tClass-encode ALU result mux\nhyp-20261003-002-r7s1\tstructural\tregression\t124.08\t1.67\t63.484\t5116484\t2949\t10\tSplit EX operand and ALU stages\nhyp-20261003-003-r7s2\tpredictor\tregression\t95.1\t-22.07\t40.541\t4262877\t3331\t27\tRegistered lookahead next-PC predictor\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
