 folding\tregression\t3.88%\t126.77\t52.591\t4148413\t60\tclock_ibuf>cpu/u_id>cpu/u_ex>cpu/u_if>cpu/u_id\nhyp-20261003-003-r11s2\tID-registered target prefetch predictor\tregression\t-1.07%\t120.74\t51.43\t4259618\t14\tclock_ibuf>cpu/u_id>cpu/u_ex>cpu/u_ex/u_alu>cpu/u_ex\nhyp-20261003-003-r12s2\tLate-verified direct target predictor\tregression\t-5.69%\t115.09\t49.63\t4312308\t59\tclock_ibuf>cpu/u_id>cpu/u_ex>cpu/u_if>cpu/u_ex\nhyp-20261003-003-r13s2\tPrechecked redirect-fill BTIC\tregression\t-28.53%\t87.22\t36.672\t4204420\t61\tclock_ibuf>cpu/u_id>cpu/u_ex>cpu/u_if>cpu/u_ex>cpu/u_if>cpu/u_id/u_imm>cpu/u_id\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
